# .gitignore for a Vivado / Vitis 2023.1 project
#
# Tracked (needed to rebuild the design):
#   mult_soc_sh.xpr            Vivado project file
#   mult_soc_sh.srcs/          block design (.bd) and IP settings (.xci)
#   ip_repo/                   custom AXI-Lite IPs (mult_16_bit, sc_fifo_axi)
#   multiplier_sh/             multiplier module + testbench (steps 1-2)
#   *.xsa                      exported hardware (includes the bitstream)
#   mult_soc_vitis/<app>/      Vitis application sources and project files
#   mult_soc_vitis/<plat>/     Vitis platforms (BSP with drivers set to none)
#
# Ignored: everything Vivado/Vitis regenerates on its own.

## Vivado generated folders (rebuilt by synthesis / Generate Output Products)
*.cache/
*.gen/
*.runs/
*.hw/
*.ip_user_files/
*.sim/
.Xil/

## Vivado logs, journals and backups
*.jou
*.log
*.str
*.backup.*
webtalk*

## Block design outputs regenerated from the .bd file
*.srcs/sources_1/bd/*/hdl/
*.srcs/sources_1/bd/*/hw_handoff/
*.srcs/sources_1/bd/*/ipshared/
*.srcs/sources_1/bd/*/synth/
*.srcs/sources_1/bd/*/sim/

## Vitis workspace (settings are specific to this PC)
.metadata/
RemoteSystemsTempFiles/
.analytics

## Vitis build outputs (rebuilt with the hammer button)
Debug/
Release/
logs/
